    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d164">

                <pb facs="0266" n="186" xml:id="pg186"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President to German Emperor</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Executive Mansion</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-08-06"><hi rendition="#italic">August 6,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I learn with deep sorrow of the death of Your Majesty’s beloved mother, the
                    Dowager Empress Queen Frederick. Her noble qualities have endeared her memory to
                    the American people, in whose name, and in my own, I tender to Your Majesty
                    heartfelt condolence.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William McKinley.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
